    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Agentic Jigsaw Interaction Learning for Enhancing Visual Perception and Reasoning in <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zeng%2C+Y">Yu Zeng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Huang%2C+W">Wenxuan Huang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Huang%2C+S">Shiting Huang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bao%2C+X">Xikun Bao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Qi%2C+Y">Yukun Qi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhao%2C+Y">Yiming Zhao</a>, 
      
